id: pm-u43m
title: Linked test sandbox cleanup can fail with ENOTEMPTY
description: pm test --run can report failure after linked commands pass because linked-test sandbox cleanup removes /tmp/pm-linked-test-* without retries. The failure was reproduced twice as ENOTEMPTY on the schema directory while validating pm-changelog integration.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: cleanup,linked-test,tests
created_at: "2026-05-23T20:44:49.461Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-26T17:26:50.973Z"
author: codex-pm-changelog
parent: pm-7811
release: v2026.5.24
severity: medium
resolution: "Linked-test sandbox cleanup now retries recursive removal, matching other temp cleanup paths."
expected_result: "pm test --run exits 0 when linked commands pass, even if the OS briefly keeps sandbox directories busy."
actual_result: pm test pm-7811 --run and pm test pm-u43m --run both passed after reinstalling the patched CLI; focused test-command unit suite passed 40 tests.
component: linked-test
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind}:
  pm-7811,implements,"2026-07-26T17:26:50.665Z",null,null
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-05-23T20:50:19.678Z",codex-pm-changelog,"Evidence: patched linked-test sandbox cleanup to use fs.rm maxRetries/retryDelay. Reproduced previous ENOTEMPTY before reinstalling patched CLI, then reran pm test for pm-7811 and pm-u43m successfully after npm install -g .; focused node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/test-command.spec.ts passed 40 tests."
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  src/cli/commands/test.ts,project,Retry linked-test sandbox cleanup to avoid ENOTEMPTY after successful commands
tests[3]:
  - command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/test-command.spec.ts
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 120
  - command: pnpm build
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 180
  - command: "pnpm changelog:pm:check"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 60
    pm_context_mode: tracker
test_runs[3]{run_id,kind,status,started_at,finished_at,recorded_at,passed,failed,skipped}:
  test-local-mpitiu71-0v5lqn,test,passed,"2026-05-23T20:45:43.652Z","2026-05-23T20:45:47.485Z","2026-05-23T20:45:47.485Z",2,0,0
  test-local-mpitm87d-d0qvp8,test,passed,"2026-05-23T20:48:21.109Z","2026-05-23T20:48:25.609Z","2026-05-23T20:48:25.609Z",2,0,0
  test-local-mpitn60c-qie9hx,test,passed,"2026-05-23T20:49:04.710Z","2026-05-23T20:49:09.420Z","2026-05-23T20:49:09.420Z",2,0,0
close_reason: Fixed linked-test sandbox cleanup retry and verified linked pm tests plus focused test-command suite.
